  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Information Campaign to Deter Potential Irregular Maritime Migration from Bangladesh to Australia in 2024-25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This 12-month project aims to primarily raise awareness on reducing irregular maritime and land movements for Bangladeshis. The project will also focus on raising awareness on the same issues for Rohingya refugees. For Bangladeshi citizens, there will be a combination of messages around safe migration practices, while raising their awareness of the risks associated with irregular migration, implemented in four selected districts of Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
